             CORS is set to allow all origins, which is insecure for production.
             Fix: Specify allowed origins instead of using allow_origins=['*'].
  [MEDIUM  ] MassAssignment in app/models/users.py
             The User model exposes fields like password directly.
             Fix: Use Pydantic models to control which fields are exposed.
