             UserCreate and UserUpdate schemas do not limit username length.
             Fix: Add max_length to username field in UserCreate and UserUpdate schemas.
  [MEDIUM  ] WeakJWT in app/utils/auth.py
             Weak SECRET_KEY used for JWT tokens.
             Fix: Use a strong, randomly generated secret key for JWT.
